  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If Your Hair's Too Long (There's Sin in Your Heart)**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **In Hiding**: back after 107 archived shows (729 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-09-18.BillyStringsSPACSaratogaNY** (recommended): audience recording; 14 songs; 73 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This was the final show of Billy Strings' Outlaw tour, and the setlist's initial letters spell out a thank-you message to Willie [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-09-18.BillyStringsSPACSaratogaNY**: taped by Stealth; transferred by JT/NY; source: Source: Aud > Church Audio's / CAFS > CA9400 > Edirol R07 @ 24/48 [1]. Also: Audience recording using Church Audio microphones, a CA9200 preamp and a Roland R07 at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer path: SD card to 24/48, tracked and edited in Sound Forge Pro 16, then converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]",
